<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Delete Account Guide - Delete & Deactivate Social Media Accounts</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Find official instructions and links to delete or deactivate your Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, X, Snapchat, Reddit or YouTube account.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

  <header class="header">
    <div class="container nav">
      <a href="#" class="logo">
        <span>✦</span> DeleteGuide
      </a>

      <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Open menu">☰</button>

      <nav id="navMenu">
        <a href="#platforms">Platforms</a>
        <a href="#how">How It Works</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>


  <main>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-content">

        <div class="badge">🔐 No Password Required</div>

        <h1>Delete or Deactivate Your Social Media Account</h1>

        <p>
          Find the official account deletion or deactivation process
          for popular social media platforms — quickly and safely.
        </p>

        <div class="search-box">
          <span>🔎</span>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="searchInput"
            placeholder="Search Instagram, Facebook, TikTok..."
            autocomplete="off"
          >
        </div>

        <div class="security-note">
          <strong>🔒 Your privacy comes first.</strong>
          We never ask for, collect or store your password.
          You complete the process directly on the official platform.
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- PLATFORMS -->
    <section class="platform-section" id="platforms">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading">
          <span>POPULAR PLATFORMS</span>
          <h2>What account do you want to manage?</h2>
          <p>Select a platform to see its official deletion and deactivation options.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="platform-grid" id="platformGrid">


          <!-- INSTAGRAM -->
          <article class="platform-card" data-name="instagram">
            <div class="platform-icon instagram">◎</div>

            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>Instagram</h3>
              <p>Delete or deactivate your Instagram account.</p>

              <div class="card-buttons">
                <a
                  class="btn btn-primary"
                  href="https://www.instagram.com/accounts/remove/request/permanent/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Delete Account ↗
                </a>

                <a
                  class="btn btn-secondary"
                  href="https://help.instagram.com/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Help Guide
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- FACEBOOK -->
          <article class="platform-card" data-name="facebook">
            <div class="platform-icon facebook">f</div>

            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>Facebook</h3>
              <p>Permanently delete or temporarily deactivate Facebook.</p>

              <div class="card-buttons">
                <a
                  class="btn btn-primary"
                  href="https://www.facebook.com/help/224562897555674/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Delete Account ↗
                </a>

                <a
                  class="btn btn-secondary"
                  href="https://www.facebook.com/help/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Help Guide
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- TIKTOK -->
          <article class="platform-card" data-name="tiktok">
            <div class="platform-icon tiktok">♪</div>

            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>TikTok</h3>
              <p>Delete or deactivate your TikTok account.</p>

              <div class="card-buttons">
                <a
                  class="btn btn-primary"
                  href="https://support.tiktok.com/en/account-and-privacy/deleting-an-account/deleting-an-account"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Delete Guide ↗
                </a>

                <a
                  class="btn btn-secondary"
                  href="https://support.tiktok.com/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Help Center
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- X -->
          <article class="platform-card" data-name="x twitter">
            <div class="platform-icon x-icon">𝕏</div>

            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>X (Twitter)</h3>
              <p>Deactivate your X account and begin the deletion process.</p>

              <div class="card-buttons">
                <a
                  class="btn btn-primary"
                  href="https://help.x.com/en/managing-your-account/how-to-deactivate-x-account"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Delete Guide ↗
                </a>

                <a
                  class="btn btn-secondary"
                  href="https://help.x.com/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Help Center
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- SNAPCHAT -->
          <article class="platform-card" data-name="snapchat">
            <div class="platform-icon snapchat">👻</div>

            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>Snapchat</h3>
              <p>Deactivate or delete your Snapchat account.</p>

              <div class="card-buttons">
                <a
                  class="btn btn-primary"
                  href="https://accounts.snapchat.com/accounts/delete_account"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Delete Account ↗
                </a>

                <a
                  class="btn btn-secondary"
                  href="https://help.snapchat.com/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Help Center
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- REDDIT -->
          <article class="platform-card" data-name="reddit">
            <div class="platform-icon reddit">●</div>

            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>Reddit</h3>
              <p>Permanently delete your Reddit account.</p>

              <div class="card-buttons">
                <a
                  class="btn btn-primary"
                  href="https://www.reddit.com/settings/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Account Settings ↗
                </a>

                <a
                  class="btn btn-secondary"
                  href="https://support.reddithelp.com/hc/en-us/articles/204579509-How-do-I-delete-my-account"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Delete Guide
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- YOUTUBE -->
          <article class="platform-card" data-name="youtube">
            <div class="platform-icon youtube">▶</div>

            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>YouTube</h3>
              <p>Hide or permanently delete your YouTube channel.</p>

              <div class="card-buttons">
                <a
                  class="btn btn-primary"
                  href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/55759"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  Delete Guide ↗
                </a>

                <a
                  class="btn btn-secondary"
                  href="https://studio.youtube.com/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  YouTube Studio
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>


          <!-- COMING SOON -->
          <article class="platform-card coming-soon">
            <div class="platform-icon">＋</div>

            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>More Platforms</h3>
              <p>More account deletion guides will be added soon.</p>

              <div class="coming-label">COMING SOON</div>
            </div>
          </article>

        </div>

        <div class="no-results" id="noResults">
          <div>🔎</div>
          <h3>No platform found</h3>
          <p>Try searching for Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, X, Snapchat, Reddit or YouTube.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
    <section class="how-section" id="how">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading">
          <span>SIMPLE & SAFE</span>
          <h2>How it works</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="steps">

          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number">01</div>
            <h3>Choose Platform</h3>
            <p>Select the social media account you want to delete or deactivate.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number">02</div>
            <h3>Open Official Page</h3>
            <p>We send you directly to the platform's official website or help center.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number">03</div>
            <h3>Complete the Process</h3>
            <p>Log in and confirm the action directly with the platform.</p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- SAFETY -->
    <section class="safety-section">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="safety-box">

          <div class="safety-icon">🔐</div>

          <div>
            <h2>Never enter your password here</h2>

            <p>
              DeleteGuide does not need your Instagram, Facebook,
              TikTok or any other social-media password.
              Your login details should only be entered on the
              official platform.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="faq-section" id="faq">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading">
          <span>FAQ</span>
          <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-list">

          <details>
            <summary>Can this website delete my account automatically?</summary>
            <p>
              No. DeleteGuide does not log into your account or perform
              account deletion on your behalf. It helps you reach the
              official platform's deletion process.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Do you store my password?</summary>
            <p>
              No. This website does not ask for or store your social-media
              password.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Is account deletion always permanent?</summary>
            <p>
              Deletion rules and recovery periods vary by platform.
              Always read the platform's final confirmation screen before
              completing deletion.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Should I download my data first?</summary>
            <p>
              Yes. If you have photos, videos, posts or other information
              you want to keep, download or back up your data before
              permanently deleting your account.
            </p>
          </details>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>


  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container footer-content">

      <div>
        <a href="#" class="logo">
          <span>✦</span> DeleteGuide
        </a>

        <p>
          A simple guide to official social media account
          deletion and deactivation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="#platforms">Platforms</a>
        <a href="#how">How It Works</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="copyright">
      © 2026 DeleteGuide. For informational purposes only.
    </div>
  </footer>


  <script src="script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
